  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2484,
      "text": "The reckoning of the people has drawn near, yet they are turning away heedlessly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2485,
      "text": "Whenever new revelation comes to them from their Lord, they listen to it in jest,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2486,
      "text": "with their hearts heedless. The wrongdoers whisper to one another in secret, “Is this but a human being just like yourselves? Will you then follow his magic, although you openly see?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2487,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord knows every word spoken in the heavens and earth, for He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2488,
      "text": "Yet they say, “This [Qur’an] is a set of jumbled dreams! Rather, he has fabricated it! Rather, he is a poet! So let him bring us a sign just as the earlier messengers were sent with[1].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2489,
      "text": "Not a single town We destroyed before them had believed[2]. Will they then believe?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2490,
      "text": "We did not send before you [O Prophet] except men to whom We gave a revelation, so [O people] ask the People of the Scriptures if you do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2491,
      "text": "We did not give them bodies that needed no food[3], nor were they immortal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2492,
      "text": "Then We fulfilled Our promise to them: We saved them[4] and those whom We willed, and destroyed those who transgressed all bounds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 322,
      "ruku": 278,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2493,
      "text": "We have sent down to you [O people] a Book in which there is honor for you[5]. Do you not then understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
